    "detailed_description": "Raise an army of ghouls as the Lord vampire or incarnate one of Heroneus's knights in <strong>Versus Vampire</strong>.<br><br>Versus Vampire is the first multiplayer game based on the game-creation sandbox Playcraft:<br><br><br><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Choose between vampires and humans in this new multiplayer battle arena.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f094090c36ba4560dd8fd85d1a263a22.poster.avif?t=1706994210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f094090c36ba4560dd8fd85d1a263a22.webm?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f094090c36ba4560dd8fd85d1a263a22.mp4?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>As the Lord vampire, use magic powers to raise and command your army.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ef0680b17d162b1cc1232c1f5d899905.poster.avif?t=1706994210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ef0680b17d162b1cc1232c1f5d899905.webm?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ef0680b17d162b1cc1232c1f5d899905.mp4?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>As Heroneus's Knights, grab your swords and holly spells to stop the Lord before he takes over the village.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f5db81fee1a308a6864c2424c6c33cdf.poster.avif?t=1706994210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f5db81fee1a308a6864c2424c6c33cdf.webm?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/f5db81fee1a308a6864c2424c6c33cdf.mp4?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li>Team up with friends online and have fun slaying with style.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ddc76f3174badc2e625b3c094a28ed18.poster.avif?t=1706994210\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ddc76f3174badc2e625b3c094a28ed18.webm?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/ddc76f3174badc2e625b3c094a28ed18.mp4?t=1706994210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2476580/extras/7110aa517eef715ff081fd018c3e2f00.avif?t=1706994210\" /></span>",
